hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1121","(147) Ghall (khiyanat karne wale) ke saman ko jalane aur us ki saza ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Bahr al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, apne walid se, apne dada se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar ne ghall (khiyanat karne wale) ko kode se mara aur us ka saman jala diya aur us ka hissa rok liya."
